{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1154","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Make Them Equal"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a sequence $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can choose any non-negative integer $$$D$$$ (i.e. $$$D \\ge 0$$$), and for each $$$a_i$$$ you can:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$D$$$ (only once), i. e. perform $$$a_i := a_i + D$$$, or "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" subtract $$$D$$$ (only once), i. e. perform $$$a_i := a_i - D$$$, or "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" leave the value of $$$a_i$$$ unchanged. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is possible that after an operation the value $$$a_i$$$ becomes negative."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your goal is to choose such "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum non-negative integer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$D$$$ and perform changes in such a way, that all $$$a_i$$$ are equal (i.e. $$$a_1=a_2=\\dots=a_n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the required $$$D$$$ or, if it is impossible to choose such value $$$D$$$, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, for array $$$[2, 8]$$$ the value $$$D=3$$$ is minimum possible because you can obtain the array $$$[5, 5]$$$ if you will add $$$D$$$ to $$$2$$$ and subtract $$$D$$$ from $$$8$$$. And for array $$$[1, 4, 7, 7]$$$ the value $$$D=3$$$ is also minimum possible. You can add it to $$$1$$$ and subtract it from $$$7$$$ and obtain the array $$$[4, 4, 4, 4]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 100$$$) — the number of elements in $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 100$$$) — the sequence $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum non-negative integer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" value $$$D$$$ such that if you add this value to some $$$a_i$$$, subtract this value from some $$$a_i$$$ and leave some $$$a_i$$$ without changes, all obtained values become equal."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If it is impossible to choose such value $$$D$$$, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level"